Package: RandlesID
Title: Fast Computation of Randles Interdirections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Erik",
        family = "Mendros",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "erikmendros@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Provides fast algorithms for computing Randles
    interdirections for multivariate data in dimensions three and
    higher. The implementation uses a sweep algorithm in dimension
    three and dimension reduction for higher-dimensional data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
